    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ac7b92c7c7066474d0944a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这个疑问十分难解。但是，\n得知谷野美酒的参赛计划后，\n我的心中出现了一个假设。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d40b218d7c89662656d1f375769891047f75649560d6000d607723b451c943",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
