    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66a6e14fc6bcc1a083e38700",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要先说明的是，经典级──\n尤其在春季这段时间，\n大部分的赛马娘身体都还不是最完美的状态……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad34dc70b835e637a6a96274d69065a6a59ae2c9caf21b601faddcead72f6a4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
