      "uid": "zhcn:666470321f3ac8a004c1c8cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果以这个“资质”的角度\n来看谷野美酒的参赛计划，\n她真正的意图就会稍稍浮出台面──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b37482d6122a1aa9ba40485f10d63658500923adcacf245ea9e168d169c48af",
