      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错。\n赛马娘的距离资质正是由天生的“资质”决定。\n只有这一点是无法靠训练改变的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f802867ea226c78724cc84d9a556263d61fcfebaa98dba5919e7976ef40b16f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
