      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来吉兆也一步步推导出同个假设了。\n那么重新审视谷野美酒的计划──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c23e021f81a0c8b0036cf2648a6eee10d3582ceaa273402b170d040fb10f9699",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
