      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皋月赏”后，谷野美酒将连续参加\n1600米的“NHK英里C”与\n2400米的“日本德比”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ce1aa6f691dd210a4252aab209080f5c475767a6a7a00c1457b56424cdad9b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
