    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:324c1136c403bafe37fbef93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "连续征战要求天生速度飞快的1600米，\n以及必须拥有强劲综合实力的2400米。\n在英里后直接挑战经典距离。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d457b6476c6c96b89fe16bf7d3d7ae08d1f2a86058c3f0241c047f19286fdf52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
