      "uid": "zhcn:02e818f3b7bdfa21dbeaf54b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一定就是去年出现挑战者后，\n造成话题的参赛计划方案……\n“MC参赛计划”……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "122e85c87ad83b739309ea3b5f9c5618f379b6ed42fa04ea06e6d8c73e0f80fd",
